  "memo": "R02 holds because the device is shared by three accounts. Its recent account association prevents the household exception. Linkage is the only adverse family; no other rule holds, no earlier outcome settles the order, and no check has completed. Ordinary household sharing remains plausible, while coordinated identities are an unresolved alternative. Recommend needs_check under §6.6(b), implemented as a hold with id_check before shipment. This check establishes account identity and card possession. Clear and decline are not currently permitted. No installments were due, so repayment intent cannot support the recommendation."
